        <briefdescription>
<para>Top-level key handler for normal (non-popup) terminals. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Dispatches:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Modal intercept (<computeroutput><ref refid="classterminal_1_1_input_1a3b1959b308488cf256fb7bfbd787535d" kindref="member">handleModalKey</ref></computeroutput>) when a modal is active.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Action system (<computeroutput>action::handleKeyPress</computeroutput>).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Clear-and-forward — clears selection state, then sends to PTY.</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>key</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The key press to handle. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para><computeroutput>true</computeroutput> — all key events are consumed. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>MESSAGE THREAD. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
<para>Preview dismiss takes priority over all other modal handling. Any key while isPreviewActive removes the preview IMAGE node and deactivates the split viewport. The lambda evaluates to true so the result is consumed.</para>
