        <briefdescription>
<para>Handles a key event while vim-style selection mode is active. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Reads/writes selection state via <computeroutput><ref refid="structterminal_1_1_model" kindref="compound">Model</ref></computeroutput> params. Returns <computeroutput>true</computeroutput> if the key was consumed; always returns <computeroutput>true</computeroutput> (selection mode is fully modal).</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>key</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The key press. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para><computeroutput>true</computeroutput> — selection mode consumes all keys. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>MESSAGE THREAD. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
